  "retired_yard_wagons": {
    "_doc": "T-3558, Kevin 2026-11-16: \"replace any parked wagons with these photographic wagons, you may not need to keep all of the parked wagons given the ones in motion\". Procedural farm-box and covered wagons of data/yard/town_trade_goods.json that no photographic row replaces are not drawn: the ten moving teams now carry the street traffic, only the photographic covered pair is qualified as a covered wagon, and a photographic farm box stands only where its four wheels find level ground (the parked layer's 30 mm wheel plane): most street verges slope to the gutter. Carts are not wagons and are untouched. The records themselves stay in town_trade_goods.json (the generator's own output, guarded by farm-box-protected.json); parked-transport.js hands the list to the yard layer (`retiredIds`), which never builds them, so neither the reach nor the far merge can draw one. Liberty L-1835-parked-farm-box.",
